  "title": "ServiceTitan Report Finds AI Adoption More Than Doubles Among Commercial Contractors as Firms Turn to Technology to Navigate Cost Pressures",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES – March 30, 2026 – ServiceTitan (Nasdaq: TTAN), the software platform that powers the trades, today released its 2026 Commercial Specialty Contractor Industry Report, a survey of more than 1,000 commercial construction leaders. The report finds that AI adoption is accelerating rapidly across the industry, with 38% of contractors now reporting measurable business impact from AI, up from 17% in 2025.",
